  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta bidrag ska anv&#xe4;ndas f&#xf6;r preparat program och bed&#xf6;mningar, externa bed&#xf6;mningar, &#xf6;vervakning, utv&#xe4;rderingar, politiska studier och ger r&#xe5;d i form av konsulter i samband med den offentliga f&#xf6;rvaltningen reformprocessen. Syftet med bidraget &#xe4;r att &#xf6;ka kvaliteten p&#xe5; utvecklingssamarbetet p&#xe5; omr&#xe5;det f&#xf6;r reformer av den offentliga f&#xf6;rvaltningen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution is to be used for programme preparations and assessments, external appraisals, monitoring, evaluations, policy studies and advises in the form of consultancies related to the Public Administration Reform process. The purpose of the contribution is to increase the quality of the development cooperation activities in the area of public administration reforms.</narrative>
  </description>
